          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hanna started out writing product descriptions for a furniture shop, three hundred of them in her first year. She learned that the plain ones sold and the clever ones did not.</p><p>She now writes for small businesses, runs a monthly workshop and sends a short edit every other week. This is sample text. Replace it with your own story.</p>"
